' =====================================================================
'  _legend.puml - colour key for the building blocks used in class and sequence diagrams
'  Include it in a diagram that needs the key. No @startuml / @enduml.
' =====================================================================
legend top right
|= Stereotype |= Meaning |
|<#E6F0FB> «boundary»     | Driving adapter: UI, HTTP route, CLI, consumer |
|<#E7F4EA> «service»      | Application service / use-case orchestration |
|<#FFE6CC> «aggregate»    | Aggregate root |
|<#FFF2CC> «entity»       | Entity inside an aggregate |
|<#FBF2D9> «value object» | Immutable value defined by its attributes |
|<#EEE7F7> «port»         | Interface the core owns; its adapter implements it |
|<#ECECEC> «infra»        | Database, queue, third-party system |
endlegend
